The original license from David Murray, the creator of Attack of the PETSCII
Robots:

    The source code to ATTACK OF THE PETSCII ROBOTS is provided for
    educational purposes and to assist in the porting of the game to other
    systems.

    As a courtesy, please inform DAVID MURRAY, the creator of ATTACK OF THE
    PETSCII ROBOTS, of your intentions. While you are free to distribute any
    ports you create based on this code, commercial distribution is strictly
    forbidden unless permission is gained from DAVID MURRAY.

Additional resources were pulled in from the Amiga version of the game, by
Vesa Halttunen with art by Piotr Radecki, under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International license:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
